ore.Lookup`; `Run` reattach | `TestRunSupersededPairIdenticalRetry`, `TestSupersedeKeepsReceipts` |\n20|| Supersede is no-replace per pair | `Store.Supersede` → `installPair` | `TestSupersedeConcurrentDifferentOps`, `TestSupersedeConcurrentSamePairReplays` |\n21|| Crash seams converge (both install paths) | `Store` + `Hooks` | `TestBindCrashChildSelfTerminates`, `TestSupersedeCrashSeams` |\n22|| Unknown is not absent (anchor/pair/lease) | `Store.Status`/`Lookup`/`SessionBound`; `Run` | `TestStatusUnknownIsNotAbsent`, `TestRunTornBindingPropagates`, `TestRunTornLeasePropagates` |\n23|| After-restore 1-5 (fencing precedes materialization) | `Decide` restore mode | `TestDecideAfterRestoreSequence`, `TestDecideRemoteOwnerPrecedesMaterialization` |\n24|| Remote parks / offers, no remote emission | `Decide` → `decideParked`; `Run` | `TestRunRemoteNonInteractiveParksWithoutEmission` |\n25|| Credential conditional, every caller | `Decide` → `checkRealm` | `TestDecideForegroundCredentialRequiresRealm`, `TestRunSmokeRequiredPasses` |\n26|| Realm row binds host/build/generation; any-match | `Decide` → `checkRealmBinding` | `TestDecideRealmEvidenceOrderIndependent`, `TestDecideRealmBindingMismatchRefuses` |\n27|| Dead realm row → typed capability_unavailable | `Decide` → `deadRealmRefusal` | `TestDecideExpiredRealmRowRefusesUnavailable`, `TestDecidePreRebootRealmRowRefusesUnavailable` |\n28|| Live row + backend fault keeps backend class | `Decide` → `admitBackend` | `TestDecideLiveRealmRowBackendFaultStands` |\n29|| Cached evidence never authorizes | `Decide` → `checkRealm` + `checkSmoke` | `TestRealmCarriesNoCachedEvidence` |\n30|| Non-interactive create requires headless_creation | `Decide` → backend conditionals | `TestDecideNonInteractiveRequiresHeadless` |\n31|\n32|## Backend / capabilities (§4.B, §4.D)\n33|\n34|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n35|| --- | --- | --- |\n36|| Manifest/probe/evidence identity + reconcile | `Decide` → `admitBackend` | `TestDecideTable` backend rows |\n37|| Only admitted rows authorize | `terminalbackend` via `Decide` | `TestDecideTable`, `TestTerminalBackendRefusesUnproven` |\n38|| Operation, entrypoint, descriptor admission | `Decide` | `TestDecideRestoreRequiresRestoreCapability`, entrypoint/descriptor rows |\n39|\n40|## Terminal events (§5.2)\n41|\n42|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n43|| --- | --- | --- |\n44|| session.parked vocabulary + authorship under lease | `EmitParked` → `Emit` → `AuthorizeMutation` | `TestEmitParkedRoundTrip`, `TestEmitParkedVocabularyLoop`, `TestRunParkedEmits` |\n45|| Losing-lease emission refused at mutation gate | `Emit` → `AuthorizeMutation` | `TestEmitUnderLosingLeaseRefuses` |\n46|| Remote/unverifiable/unfolderable parks emit nothing | `Run` pre-checks; `Emit` fold gate | `TestRunParkedUnfoldableSkipsEmission`, `TestEmitParkedUnfoldableRefuses` |\n47|| v4 terminal binding payloads | `BuildDescriptor` fixtures | `TestV4TerminalPayloadsParse` |\n48|\n49|## Newest checkpoint (§5.7, §13.11, §14.4)\n50|\n51|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n52|| --- | --- | --- |\n53|| Newest derived from chain fold | `LoadNewestCheckpoint` → `sessstate.Reduce` | `TestRunEpochOneOwnerAfterCheckpoint` |\n54|| Null fold + requirement parks (journal/checkpoint) | `checkMaterialization` / `admitCheckpoint` | `TestDecideJournalNullFoldParks`, `TestDecideCheckpointNullFoldParks`, `TestRunNullFoldRestoreParks` |\n55|| Unpublished checkpoint parks | `admitCheckpoint` newest arm | `TestDecideCheckpointUnpublishedParks` |\n56|| Lease/fold disagreement parks | `leaseCheckpointAgrees` | `TestDecideCheckpointLeaseFoldDisagreeParks`, `TestDecideJournalLeaseFoldDisagreeParks` |\n57|| Committed newest-sourced journal resumes | `checkMaterialization` | `TestRunRestoreCommitted`, step3 |\n58|\n59|## Profile (§2.4) and descriptor (§7.A)\n60|\n61|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n62|| --- | --- | --- |\n63|| Effective profile + source (head/closure) | `d