oint and parked every session that was ever taken over. The fold is the sole newest authority; the only asserted fact is the implication \"a checkpoint-carrying winner means the fold published a newest\" (one site, directly after fencing), and the profile closure comes from the checkpoint actually resumed, never `Winner.Checkpoint`.\n+- Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree; no review acceptance or main integration claimed.\n","final_result":true}}}
